    "characters": 1440,
    "text": "MUTUAL NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT\nThis Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement is made on 4 May 2026 between Tidewater Robotics Ltd.\nand Northgate Foods plc (each a Party).\n1. Purpose. The Parties wish to discuss a possible supply of warehouse automation equipment and\nmay share confidential information for that purpose only.\n2. Confidential Information. Confidential Information means all non-public information disclosed by a\nParty, in any form, that is marked confidential or would reasonably be understood to be confidential.\n3. Obligations. The receiving Party shall keep Confidential Information secret, shall use it only for\nthe Purpose, and may disclose it to employees, advisers, affiliates and prospective investors.\n4. Term. This Agreement starts on the date above and continues for two (2) years. The obligations\nin clause 3 survive for one (1) year after it ends.\n5. Return of Information. On written request the receiving Party shall return or destroy all\nConfidential Information within 30 days and confirm in writing that it has done so.\n6. No Licence. Nothing in this Agreement grants either Party any licence or right in the other Party's\nintellectual property.\n7. Remedies. Each Party acknowledges that damages may not be an adequate remedy and that\nthe other Party may seek injunctive relief.\n8. Governing Law. This Agreement is governed by the laws of England and Wales and the courts of\nEngland have non-exclusive jurisdiction.",
